# The brows of the speaker on the accents of its voice in the game, close up and with sound
# (reports/content/2026-11-hero-head/eyes.md, "План: брови по тону"): Vino with an own head says three lines of the
# AI server through the real voice path (a Russian yes-no question, a statement, an angry line: face_brows_demo), then
# two long lines of his original voice. Needs an AI server with the scenario face_brows_demo and a TTS service, and an
# own head for BAU_952_VINO whose face profile has speech_brows; OPENGOTHIC_SPEECH_BROWS=0 films the same without the
# layer. How to run it and make the clip - scripts/bench/README.md, "Face brows clip".
# @timeout 420
seed 73013
cheat god
view clean 15
overlay off
# the server sets the hour, puts Vino in Lobart's yard and takes him over, puts the hero 2 m in front of him and asks
# him 8 s later; it holds him 30 s after his answer
wait 4000
watch BAU_952_VINO
wait 1500
cam face 40 0 10
rec clip
waitreply 120000 3000
speak BAU_952_VINO DIA_Vino_HALLO_05_02
wait 10500
speak BAU_952_VINO DIA_Vino_PERM_05_04
wait 10000
stop
